&lt;p&gt;This prototype animates the changes over time fo the 3 most contentious looking acts.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mapping Amendments</title><link>https://mixmix.nz/experiment/docref/2026_11_15/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +1300</pubDate><guid>https://mixmix.nz/experiment/docref/2026_11_15/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://mixmix.nz/experiment/docref/2026_11_15/timeline.jpg" alt="Featured image of post Mapping Amendments" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;After seeing the version history for acts in legislation.docref.nz, I wondered what the edits looked like
